1
00:00:01,084 --> 00:00:02,711
<i>You're okay.</i>

2
00:00:02,794 --> 00:00:03,837
<i>You're her sister?</i>

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,755
<i>Yes, I'm her sister.</i>

4
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:09,843
<i>But whenever something happens to her,</i>

5
00:00:09,926 --> 00:00:11,761
<i>she blames it on me.</i>

6
00:00:11,845 --> 00:00:14,597
<i>So it's true that Billy</i>
<i>really despises you.</i>

7
00:00:14,681 --> 00:00:17,434
<i>She does. She made me and my mom suffer.</i>

8
00:00:17,517 --> 00:00:19,769
<i>That's why my mom is in prison right now.</i>

9
00:00:19,853 --> 00:00:22,772
<i>So? Let me in on the gossip.</i>

10
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:24,190
<i>Is it true?</i>

11
00:00:24,274 --> 00:00:28,236
<i>Is Billy the one</i>
<i>who killed Jordan's mother?</i>

12
00:00:28,319 --> 00:00:29,571
<i>You're not listening.</i>

13
00:00:29,654 --> 00:00:32,782
<i>I already told you that it was her.</i>

14
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:34,826
<i>Oh? Really?</i>

15
00:00:34,909 --> 00:00:37,454
<i>How would I know? I mean,</i>
<i>what if it was fake?</i>

16
00:00:38,246 --> 00:00:40,665
<i>I thought you were on our side now.</i>

17
00:00:40,749 --> 00:00:42,459
<i>Why don't you believe my partner?</i>

18
00:00:42,542 --> 00:00:44,377
<i>Hey, it's not like that.</i>

19
00:00:44,461 --> 00:00:45,962
<i>I believe you.</i>

20
00:00:46,045 --> 00:00:49,466
<i>Of course, it works in my favor</i>
<i>if Billy is a criminal too.</i>

21
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:51,676
<i>I can't wait to get back at her.</i>

22
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:55,346
<i>She's such a horrible person.</i>
<i>She has a terrible attitude.</i>

23
00:00:56,598 --> 00:00:59,642
<i>Good thing I found you.</i>

24
00:00:59,726 --> 00:01:00,852
<i>Now I have allies.</i>

25
00:01:01,478 --> 00:01:02,812
<i>Cheers.</i>

26
00:01:02,896 --> 00:01:04,856
[JORDAN] <i>My father has no conscience.</i>

27
00:01:07,358 --> 00:01:10,236
<i>We'll find out the truth soon, Jordan.</i>

28
00:01:11,237 --> 00:01:12,739
<i>We're almost there.</i>

29
00:01:12,822 --> 00:01:14,032
<i>I know.</i>

30
00:01:17,202 --> 00:01:18,995
<i>That's not the only thing on my mind.</i>

31
00:01:20,455 --> 00:01:21,998
<i>Did you hear?</i>

32
00:01:22,082 --> 00:01:23,666
<i>Karen is pregnant.</i>

33
00:01:25,293 --> 00:01:27,837
<i>I just don't want what happened</i>
<i>to Mom to happen again.</i>

34
00:01:30,298 --> 00:01:32,258
<i>Karen, I just hope</i>

35
00:01:33,676 --> 00:01:37,388
<i>that he'll love and care for your baby.</i>

36
00:01:38,723 --> 00:01:40,141
<i>Unlike how he treated me.</i>

37
00:01:41,351 --> 00:01:43,228
<i>He should've protected me.</i>

38
00:01:43,895 --> 00:01:45,271
<i>Instead, he hurt me.</i>

39
00:01:46,731 --> 00:01:47,732
<i>My mom too.</i>

40
00:01:48,983 --> 00:01:51,152
<i>My biggest regret in life</i>

41
00:01:51,236 --> 00:01:54,364
<i>is that I couldn't convince my mom</i>
<i>to leave my dad.</i>

42
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,283
<i>If I had, she would still be alive today.</i>

43
00:01:57,367 --> 00:02:00,954
<i>I don't want that to happen again.</i>

44
00:02:01,037 --> 00:02:01,996
<i>To you.</i>

45
00:02:05,458 --> 00:02:06,626
<i>You still have a chance.</i>

46
00:02:07,961 --> 00:02:09,963
<i>You still have a chance to leave him.</i>

47
00:02:10,046 --> 00:02:12,048
<i>Not just for yourself,</i>

48
00:02:12,132 --> 00:02:16,010
<i>but for your future child.</i>

49
00:02:16,094 --> 00:02:18,346
<i>For my future sibling.</i>

50
00:02:30,984 --> 00:02:37,991
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

51
00:03:35,673 --> 00:03:42,680
[CLUB MUSIC PLAYING OVER SPEAKERS]

52
00:03:58,238 --> 00:04:05,245
- [CLUB MUSIC CONTINUES]
- [CHEERING]

53
00:04:19,384 --> 00:04:20,927
Excuse me.

54
00:04:21,010 --> 00:04:22,220
Excuse me, sorry.

55
00:04:22,303 --> 00:04:29,310
[CLUB MUSIC CONTINUES]

56
00:04:36,567 --> 00:04:38,152
Sorry, just passing through.

57
00:04:41,948 --> 00:04:43,157
Excuse me, excuse me.

58
00:04:43,866 --> 00:04:44,701
Excuse me!

59
00:04:46,703 --> 00:04:47,787
Excuse me.

60
00:04:47,870 --> 00:04:54,836
[CLUB MUSIC CONTINUES]

61
00:04:54,919 --> 00:04:58,298
[CHEERING]

62
00:05:00,591 --> 00:05:01,884
[KAREN] Dino!

63
00:05:01,968 --> 00:05:03,177
Dino, wait a minute!

64
00:05:04,762 --> 00:05:05,805
Dino, wait!

65
00:05:05,888 --> 00:05:07,015
What are you doing here?

66
00:05:07,098 --> 00:05:08,641
Jordan was at our house.

67
00:05:08,725 --> 00:05:09,642
Huh?

68
00:05:09,726 --> 00:05:11,185
How did he find out where we live?

69
00:05:11,269 --> 00:05:13,146
- Is it true?
- What do you mean?

70
00:05:13,229 --> 00:05:16,107
He believes that you're the one
who killed his mother.

71
00:05:16,899 --> 00:05:18,693
Well? Is it true?

72
00:05:18,776 --> 00:05:21,321
Is that why you have her necklace?

73
00:05:21,404 --> 00:05:22,363
Is it true?

74
00:05:22,447 --> 00:05:23,823
Can you please just shut it?

75
00:05:23,906 --> 00:05:25,533
Just what are you talking about, huh?

76
00:05:25,616 --> 00:05:27,160
Tell me the truth.

77
00:05:27,243 --> 00:05:29,329
You killed your wife.

78
00:05:29,412 --> 00:05:30,747
Just admit it!

79
00:05:31,706 --> 00:05:32,957
Well?

80
00:05:33,041 --> 00:05:34,709
Tell me!

81
00:05:35,335 --> 00:05:38,046
Speak up! You killed Jade!

82
00:05:38,129 --> 00:05:41,132
You did, right? So you did kill her!

83
00:05:41,215 --> 00:05:42,675
- She pushed my patience!
- [YELPS]

84
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,343
I had no other choice!

85
00:05:44,427 --> 00:05:46,721
Everything that happened
that day was Jade's fault.

86
00:05:46,804 --> 00:05:48,598
It was all her fault!

87
00:05:50,183 --> 00:05:51,684
<i>Jade!</i>

88
00:05:51,768 --> 00:05:52,810
<i>Jade, open the door!</i>

89
00:05:52,894 --> 00:05:54,687
<i>Open the door, Jade!</i>
<i>Open it, Jade!</i>

90
00:05:55,313 --> 00:05:56,522
<i>Open the door!</i>

91
00:05:58,191 --> 00:06:00,359
<i>Why were the police in my house, huh?</i>

92
00:06:01,069 --> 00:06:02,820
<i>You ratted me out, didn't you?!</i>

93
00:06:02,904 --> 00:06:05,156
<i>Dino, I don't want any more trouble.</i>

94
00:06:05,239 --> 00:06:08,242
<i>Why were they at my house?!</i>
<i>How did they know where to look for me?!</i>

95
00:06:08,326 --> 00:06:10,787
<i>Everyone knows where you're hiding, Dino!</i>

96
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:12,622
<i>At yours and your mistress's house!</i>

97
00:06:12,705 --> 00:06:14,582
[PHONE RINGING]

98
00:06:14,665 --> 00:06:15,875
<i>What? Is she looking for you?</i>

99
00:06:15,958 --> 00:06:17,794
<i>Just leave already! Get out!</i>

100
00:06:17,877 --> 00:06:20,463
<i>I'm not leaving until you admit it!</i>

101
00:06:20,546 --> 00:06:22,924
<i>Why are you accusing me?!</i>

102
00:06:23,007 --> 00:06:25,927
<i>Don't drag me into your mess, Dino!</i>

103
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:28,679
<i>Jordan and I are already living</i>
<i>a peaceful life now that you're gone!</i>

104
00:06:28,763 --> 00:06:32,058
<i>So please, just leave us alone!</i>

105
00:06:32,809 --> 00:06:34,894
<i>Or what? What are you going to do, huh?</i>

106
00:06:34,977 --> 00:06:37,355
<i>You'll send me to jail?</i>
<i>You couldn't do that!</i>

107
00:06:37,438 --> 00:06:41,234
<i>That's right! Back then, I couldn't!</i>
<i>But now I can!</i>

108
00:06:41,317 --> 00:06:44,278
<i>You're a drug pusher! An abuser!</i>

109
00:06:45,154 --> 00:06:48,866
<i>I should've sent you to jail</i>
<i>for hurting me several times!</i>

110
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:50,827
<i>The truth comes out after all!</i>

111
00:06:50,910 --> 00:06:52,078
<i>- You finally admit it!</i>
<i>- Ah!</i>

112
00:06:52,161 --> 00:06:53,955
<i>So it was you who told the police.</i>

113
00:06:54,038 --> 00:06:55,915
<i>You're the one who ratted me out!</i>

114
00:06:55,998 --> 00:06:58,709
- [CHOKING] <i>Dino!</i>
<i>- I'm going to kill you!</i>

115
00:06:58,793 --> 00:06:59,877
[SCREAMS]

116
00:06:59,961 --> 00:07:01,796
- [BLOW LANDS]
- [GROANS IN PAIN]

117
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:03,005
<i>Get over here!</i>

118
00:07:03,089 --> 00:07:04,507
- [GRUNTS]
- [SCREAMS]

119
00:07:04,590 --> 00:07:05,591
[PANTING]

120
00:07:05,675 --> 00:07:08,302
[GROWLS] <i>I'm going to kill you!</i>

121
00:07:08,386 --> 00:07:10,388
- [CHOKING]
<i>- Die! Die!</i>

122
00:07:10,471 --> 00:07:12,807
- [BLOW LANDS]
- [GROANING IN PAIN]

123
00:07:12,890 --> 00:07:14,183
<i>Help!</i>

124
00:07:16,310 --> 00:07:18,104
<i>Help!</i>

125
00:07:19,230 --> 00:07:20,773
- [DINO] <i>Jade!</i>
- [GASPS]

126
00:07:20,857 --> 00:07:22,900
<i>- Help! Aah!</i>
- [DINO] <i>Jade!</i>

127
00:07:22,984 --> 00:07:24,944
- [PANTING]
<i>- You dare run away? Come here!</i>

128
00:07:25,027 --> 00:07:26,154
<i>- Don't!</i>
- [GRUNTS]

129
00:07:26,737 --> 00:07:27,655
[GRUNTS]

130
00:07:28,781 --> 00:07:30,032
[GROANING]

131
00:07:30,116 --> 00:07:31,367
- [GRUNTS]
- [BLOW LANDS]

132
00:07:31,451 --> 00:07:32,910
- [THUDS]
- [PANTING]

133
00:07:34,370 --> 00:07:40,126
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

134
00:07:45,965 --> 00:07:47,049
[OLIVE GROANS]

135
00:07:47,133 --> 00:07:48,092
- [THUD]
- Billy!

136
00:07:48,176 --> 00:07:55,183
[OLIVE GROANING]

137
00:07:57,268 --> 00:08:00,688
[OLIVE] <i>Billy! Let's go!</i>

138
00:08:00,771 --> 00:08:05,485
- [TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]
- [OLIVE GROANING]

139
00:08:05,568 --> 00:08:07,528
[OLIVE] <i>Hurry, dear. Hurry.</i>

140
00:08:07,612 --> 00:08:09,405
[OLIVE GROANING]

141
00:08:09,489 --> 00:08:15,912
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

142
00:08:20,958 --> 00:08:21,876
<i>Jade?</i>

143
00:08:23,002 --> 00:08:24,462
<i>Your wife!</i>

144
00:08:27,965 --> 00:08:30,092
<i>She's gone. She's dead!</i>

145
00:08:30,176 --> 00:08:31,594
<i>Let's bring her to the hospital.</i>

146
00:08:31,677 --> 00:08:34,847
<i>She's already dead!</i>
<i>Why would you still do that?!</i>

147
00:08:34,931 --> 00:08:37,099
<i>Seriously? She got hit by a car.</i>

148
00:08:37,183 --> 00:08:39,143
<i>What do you want me to do?</i>
<i>Call the police, huh?!</i>

149
00:08:39,227 --> 00:08:40,603
<i>They're already hunting me down!</i>

150
00:08:40,686 --> 00:08:42,188
<i>Use that head of yours!</i>

151
00:08:44,815 --> 00:08:47,151
<i>- Let's go! Let's leave.</i>
<i>- </i>[KAREN]<i> But…</i>

152
00:08:47,235 --> 00:08:48,486
<i>We'll get in trouble.</i>

153
00:08:48,569 --> 00:08:49,946
[KAREN WHIMPERS]

154
00:08:50,029 --> 00:08:51,113
<i>Let's go!</i>

155
00:08:51,197 --> 00:08:52,323
<i>Come on!</i>

156
00:08:53,032 --> 00:08:54,033
<i>Hurry!</i>

157
00:08:54,116 --> 00:08:56,160
[KAREN CRYING]

158
00:08:56,244 --> 00:08:58,913
Jade was already dead
before she was run over?

159
00:08:59,997 --> 00:09:02,875
You killed your own wife!

160
00:09:04,168 --> 00:09:06,504
Do you think I wanted that to happen?

161
00:09:07,255 --> 00:09:09,215
Do you think it was my plan to kill Jade?

162
00:09:11,050 --> 00:09:13,010
She pushed me to the edge that day.

163
00:09:14,053 --> 00:09:17,306
If she hadn't pushed me like that,
she'd still be alive today.

164
00:09:20,768 --> 00:09:22,603
What are you going to do now?

165
00:09:22,687 --> 00:09:25,273
Are you going to send me
to jail again? Is that it?

166
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:29,902
No, no.

167
00:09:30,653 --> 00:09:31,946
I'm sorry.

168
00:09:33,030 --> 00:09:35,074
Sorry. I won't do it again.

169
00:09:37,076 --> 00:09:38,953
I promise you I won't hurt you.

170
00:09:39,036 --> 00:09:41,497
Just… I just need to do this.

171
00:09:42,248 --> 00:09:45,042
Once I get the money from Billy,
we'll leave.

172
00:09:45,126 --> 00:09:47,545
Let's go somewhere far away.

173
00:09:47,628 --> 00:09:49,046
We'll start a new life.

174
00:09:51,007 --> 00:09:52,425
Just please let me do this.

175
00:09:54,802 --> 00:09:56,053
Don't go back home either.

176
00:09:58,723 --> 00:10:00,224
Just wait for me over there.

177
00:10:00,891 --> 00:10:02,935
I'll just finish this,
and then we'll leave.

178
00:10:04,312 --> 00:10:05,646
Just let me do this.

179
00:10:05,730 --> 00:10:11,527
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES, ENDS]

180
00:10:11,611 --> 00:10:18,409
[CLUB MUSIC PLAYING OVER SPEAKERS]

181
00:10:25,374 --> 00:10:27,752
[WAITER] Hello, may I get your order?

182
00:10:27,835 --> 00:10:29,712
- One bottle of beer.
- Okay.

183
00:10:29,795 --> 00:10:36,761
[CLUB MUSIC CONTINUES]

184
00:10:52,068 --> 00:10:58,991
[CLUB MUSIC CONTINUES]

185
00:11:06,707 --> 00:11:10,002
[CLUB MUSIC CONTINUES]

186
00:11:15,716 --> 00:11:17,802
[DINO] Good evening, Ms. Billy.

187
00:11:17,885 --> 00:11:20,346
We finally meet. I'm Dino.

188
00:11:24,308 --> 00:11:25,684
Okay.

189
00:11:30,689 --> 00:11:32,024
[BAG THUDS]

190
00:11:34,276 --> 00:11:36,529
There you go.
That's what you're asking for.

191
00:11:37,988 --> 00:11:39,490
I'm not in a hurry.

192
00:11:40,825 --> 00:11:42,368
But I won't decline either.

193
00:11:43,828 --> 00:11:45,162
[ZIPPER OPENING]

194
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:53,421
I won't bother counting this here.

195
00:11:54,755 --> 00:11:56,674
You know what'll happen
if this isn't enough.

196
00:11:57,258 --> 00:12:01,429
How can I be sure that
you will no longer bother me after this?

197
00:12:01,512 --> 00:12:02,805
[SCOFFS]

198
00:12:03,806 --> 00:12:05,808
Ms. Billy, you have my word.

199
00:12:06,350 --> 00:12:07,893
You don't have to worry.

200
00:12:08,936 --> 00:12:10,187
But you don't have a choice.

201
00:12:10,271 --> 00:12:12,648
Because if I don't get this money home,

202
00:12:13,566 --> 00:12:15,734
everyone will know that you're a criminal.

203
00:12:17,027 --> 00:12:19,447
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

204
00:12:19,530 --> 00:12:24,368
You know that I had nothing to do with
Jordan's mom's death. Right?

205
00:12:27,538 --> 00:12:29,248
Who do you think did it?

206
00:12:30,458 --> 00:12:31,417
Me?

207
00:12:32,835 --> 00:12:34,253
Where's your evidence?

208
00:12:35,212 --> 00:12:36,422
Show me.

209
00:12:36,505 --> 00:12:37,673
Bring it out.

210
00:12:38,924 --> 00:12:39,967
Nothing.

211
00:12:41,385 --> 00:12:44,597
So just be quiet and thankful

212
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:48,517
that no one will ever know
that you're a murderer.

213
00:12:50,769 --> 00:12:53,147
You know what I'm thankful for?

214
00:12:53,230 --> 00:12:56,358
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

215
00:12:56,442 --> 00:12:59,528
That you'll finally
be out of my friend's life.

216
00:13:03,407 --> 00:13:06,118
You have no right to be a parent, Dino.

217
00:13:09,079 --> 00:13:13,125
Jordan is so unlucky
to have you as his father.

218
00:13:13,209 --> 00:13:20,174
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

219
00:13:23,219 --> 00:13:28,432
[MUSIC TURNS STIRRING]

220
00:13:35,439 --> 00:13:37,024
[PHONE CHIMES]

221
00:13:48,702 --> 00:13:52,623
[STIRRING MUSIC INTENSIFIES]

222
00:13:54,708 --> 00:13:59,838
[CLUB MUSIC PLAYING OVER SPEAKERS]

223
00:14:05,135 --> 00:14:08,305
Party, party!

224
00:14:10,849 --> 00:14:14,270
Let's party! Let's go!

225
00:14:22,778 --> 00:14:25,489
- Hey!
- Sorry, sorry!

226
00:14:25,573 --> 00:14:28,117
Bring your girl home! Go home!

227
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,369
- Sorry, sorry, sorry!
- Go home!

228
00:14:30,452 --> 00:14:33,956
[CHEERING]

229
00:14:34,039 --> 00:14:36,250
[DINO GRUNTS]

230
00:14:38,127 --> 00:14:39,378
[BILLY] Dude!

231
00:14:39,461 --> 00:14:41,630
Check your phone. Check it.

232
00:14:44,091 --> 00:14:45,426
[DINO GRUNTS]

233
00:14:46,886 --> 00:14:50,973
[CHEERING]

234
00:14:51,056 --> 00:14:53,017
Move aside! Get on with it!

235
00:14:53,100 --> 00:14:58,898
[CHEERING]

236
00:15:09,074 --> 00:15:10,534
- [DINO GRUNTS]
- Sorry, sir!

237
00:15:10,618 --> 00:15:12,745
What the heck?! Can you just move aside?!

238
00:15:12,828 --> 00:15:14,830
- Sir--
- Sir, what happened?

239
00:15:14,914 --> 00:15:16,790
What--I'm sorry, sir. Did you get wet?

240
00:15:16,874 --> 00:15:17,958
- I just want to go.
- Yes, sir.

241
00:15:18,042 --> 00:15:20,044
- [DINO] Move!
- I'll pay for it.

242
00:15:20,127 --> 00:15:22,004
I just want to go! Move!

243
00:15:22,922 --> 00:15:23,923
[KAREN] <i>Well?</i>

244
00:15:24,006 --> 00:15:26,425
<i>You killed Jade!</i>

245
00:15:26,508 --> 00:15:28,552
[DINO] <i>It was her fault!</i>

246
00:15:28,636 --> 00:15:30,137
<i>It was all her fault!</i>

247
00:15:31,305 --> 00:15:33,933
<i>Everything that happened</i>
<i>that day was Jade's fault.</i>

248
00:15:36,018 --> 00:15:38,979
<i>Jade was already dead</i>
<i>before she was run over?</i>

249
00:15:39,772 --> 00:15:43,275
<i>You killed your own wife?</i>

250
00:15:43,359 --> 00:15:50,115
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

251
00:15:54,578 --> 00:15:57,206
[DINO]<i> Do you think I wanted</i>
<i>that to happen?</i>

252
00:15:57,289 --> 00:15:59,708
<i>Do you think it was my plan to kill Jade?</i>

253
00:16:00,334 --> 00:16:02,461
<i>If she hadn't pushed me like that,</i>

254
00:16:03,212 --> 00:16:04,755
<i>she'd still be alive today.</i>

255
00:16:08,759 --> 00:16:14,765
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

256
00:16:18,644 --> 00:16:21,438
There's your evidence.

257
00:16:27,319 --> 00:16:30,572
- Evidence, huh?!
- [PEOPLE SCREAMING]

258
00:16:30,656 --> 00:16:33,033
- [GUNSHOTS]
- [PEOPLE SCREAMING]

259
00:16:33,117 --> 00:16:36,745
- Jordan! Jordan, no!
- Dino!

260
00:16:36,829 --> 00:16:38,205
[BILLY] Jordan!

261
00:16:38,288 --> 00:16:39,581
- Jordan!
- [WOMAN] Jordan!

262
00:16:39,665 --> 00:16:40,958
You.

263
00:16:41,041 --> 00:16:42,876
[MUSIC TURNS TENSE]

264
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,628
You killed my mom!

265
00:16:45,254 --> 00:16:46,130
Jordan.

266
00:16:46,755 --> 00:16:49,425
- Jordan, son, I didn't mean to.
- Don't call me son!

267
00:16:49,508 --> 00:16:51,677
I didn't mean for that to happen!

268
00:16:52,261 --> 00:16:54,263
I didn't mean to hit her head!

269
00:16:55,305 --> 00:16:56,765
Jordan, she would've had me arrested!

270
00:16:56,849 --> 00:16:58,642
I didn't mean for that to happen.

271
00:16:59,518 --> 00:17:01,020
Surrender now.

272
00:17:01,895 --> 00:17:03,689
I can't surrender!

273
00:17:05,649 --> 00:17:07,484
Just give me the bag, and I'll go!

274
00:17:07,568 --> 00:17:09,445
I'll vanish from your life!

275
00:17:09,528 --> 00:17:10,946
Or what?

276
00:17:12,573 --> 00:17:13,991
You'll kill me too?!

277
00:17:14,992 --> 00:17:16,368
Is that it?!

278
00:17:18,412 --> 00:17:19,705
Like you killed Mom!

279
00:17:19,788 --> 00:17:20,914
Jordan! [GRUNTS]

280
00:17:20,998 --> 00:17:22,624
- Jordan!
- [BOTH GRUNTING]

281
00:17:22,708 --> 00:17:23,584
Enough!

282
00:17:23,667 --> 00:17:25,794
[BOTH GRUNTING]

283
00:17:25,878 --> 00:17:26,837
Jordan!

284
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:33,552
- [TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]
- [BOTH GRUNTING, PANTING]

285
00:17:33,635 --> 00:17:39,808
- [JORDAN GRUNTING]
- [BLOWS LAND]

286
00:17:42,519 --> 00:17:45,481
Is this what you want, huh?!

287
00:17:46,065 --> 00:17:47,524
For me to be like you?!

288
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:55,157
- [JORDAN PANTING, GRUNTING]
- [BLOWS LAND]

289
00:18:09,296 --> 00:18:13,258
[JORDAN SOBBING]

290
00:18:15,094 --> 00:18:17,179
- [BILLY] Jordan.
- [JORDAN SOBBING]

291
00:18:17,262 --> 00:18:18,806
Jordan, please.

292
00:18:18,889 --> 00:18:20,849
- I'm not done yet!
- Jordan, enough!

293
00:18:20,933 --> 00:18:24,812
I know! I know you're mad at him.

294
00:18:25,687 --> 00:18:27,147
But you're not like him.

295
00:18:29,149 --> 00:18:31,110
He killed my mom, Billy.

296
00:18:31,693 --> 00:18:33,112
He deserves it.

297
00:18:33,195 --> 00:18:35,155
[JORDAN SOBBING]

298
00:18:35,239 --> 00:18:38,033
But you've already gotten justice
for your mom.

299
00:18:38,617 --> 00:18:40,410
Look at me. Jordan.

300
00:18:42,496 --> 00:18:45,874
He will pay for everything he has done.

301
00:18:50,587 --> 00:18:54,091
[JORDAN SOBBING]

302
00:18:54,174 --> 00:18:55,509
Let's go.

303
00:18:55,592 --> 00:18:57,636
That's enough. Please?

304
00:19:10,107 --> 00:19:12,276
[JORDAN SCREAMS]

305
00:19:12,359 --> 00:19:16,738
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

306
00:19:16,822 --> 00:19:19,741
[JORDAN SOBBING]

307
00:19:26,415 --> 00:19:29,042
[JORDAN SOBBING]

308
00:19:33,088 --> 00:19:35,257
[JORDAN SOBBING]

309
00:19:35,340 --> 00:19:42,097
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

310
00:19:55,903 --> 00:19:57,487
<i>Move aside!</i>

311
00:19:57,571 --> 00:20:00,949
[CROWD MURMURING]

312
00:20:03,452 --> 00:20:05,704
<i>Go home! Go!</i>

313
00:20:07,164 --> 00:20:11,335
<i>The manhunt for Dino Valentin</i>
<i>has finally come to an end.</i>

314
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:20,093
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]
